        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you install new solar panels?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Kilowash installs solar attic fans and cleans and maintains panel systems already on your roof. We do not sell or install new rooftop arrays.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My panels are producing less than they used to. Is cleaning worth it?",
            "answer": "<p>Usually yes, and it is the cheapest thing to try first. Dust, pollen and winter grime cut output measurably. A professional clean is far less expensive than a service call on hardware that turns out to be fine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will a fan install damage my roof?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Fans are flashed and sealed the same way a roof penetration should be. The crew is licensed and insured, and the workmanship is warrantied.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does a solar attic fan install take?",
            "answer": "<p>Most installs are a few hours. We confirm placement with you first — fan position matters more than fan count for actually moving air.</p>"
